{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166350/extras/76b3e0d70a914cd6ead42fe1f2eb650b.avif?t=1590667455\" width=614 height=165 /></span><br>Chronos - the merciless God of time - plans a devastating attack on Greece, but he knows that he cannot put his cruel plan in action with Hercules in his way! In an attempt to get rid of his adversary, Chronos casts a powerful spell on Hercules\u2026 Dark magic ages the immortal hero, taking away his might and vigor. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166350/extras/b03851f30c924d3fc3170b554ad7da46.avif?t=1590667455\" width=614 height=165 /></span><br>Hercules, deprived of his divine strength, takes the last leap of faith and throws his magic hammer through the time portal\u2026 A hero who finds it will inherit all of Hercules\u2019 power and will have the ability to defeat the evil God!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166350/extras/1fd653be16b94558a79e6100cecbc76a.avif?t=1590667455\" width=614 height=165 /></span><br>The hammer is found by none other than Alexis - a teenage daughter of the hero himself! The brave girl has always dreamt of becoming a mighty warrior, so she grabs the hammer and sets off on a dangerous battle with the God of time. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166350/extras/aa50bf9286078c69e18236d48e4dc919.avif?t=1590667455\" width=614 height=165 /></span><br>Accompany Alexis on her journey to become the hero she always wanted to be! Recruit allies, build forces and prepare for the battle of the century. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166350/extras/48f3884ba00a2356eb090d12dee1452c.avif?t=1590667455\" width=614 height=165 /></span><br>There is no time to lose: the clock is ticking!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166350/extras/ff0acf761649855a4c53b3f5c3c3fffc.avif?t=1590667455\" width=614 height=165 /></span><br>The newest time-management strategy game from JetDogs! Think strategically, solve numerous puzzles, manage resources and travel to new locations with Alexis Almighty!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Meet the beautiful and brave daughter of Hercules!<br></li><li> Fight alongside Alexis and defeat the evil god of time!<br></li><li> Over 70 thrilling levels + BONUS puzzles!<br></li><li> Enjoy stunning full HD graphics!<br></li><li> Take a fresh look at the familiar genre!<br></li><li> Explore new locations, quests and puzzles!<br></li><li> Beautiful wallpapers<br></li><li> Interactive guide</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166350/extras/c7589bbc3a68aee90a753a0eaf3eda96.avif?t=1590667455\" width=614 height=165 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ea6654093ab0c51ebecb9975f35565bfbd7005e9.jpg","localized_name":"Chapter One","name":"Chapter One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1166350/ea6654093ab0c51ebecb9975f35565bfbd7005e9.jpg"},{"icon":"ea6654093ab0c51ebecb9975f35565bfbd7005e9.jpg","localized_name":"Chapter Two","name":"Chapter Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1166350/ea6654093ab0c51ebecb9975f35565bfbd7005e9.jpg"},{"icon":"ea6654093ab0c51ebecb9975f35565bfbd7005e9.jpg","localized_name":"Chapter Three","name":"Chapter Three","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1166350/ea6654093ab0c51ebecb9975f35565bfbd7005e9.jpg"},{"icon":"ea6654093ab0c51ebecb9975f35565bfbd7005e9.jpg